@startuml
' UC-1 through UC-17 — Scenario preparation, Runtime Situation, and GM Turn
title UC-1 — Scenario 준비부터 Runtime Adventure 완료까지

start
:Storybook 준비;
:Primary 선택, Integration Prompt 및\nCreativity 설정;
:Scenario Compilation;
if (READY인가?) then (yes)
  :Adventure Start;
  :Scenario Model과 source 구성 lock;
  :초기 Game State와 locked Scenario Model로\nFirst Situation 구성;
else (no)
  :BLOCKED diagnostics 제공;
  stop
endif

repeat
  :Solo Player가 행동 선언;
  :현재 Situation 및 관련 사실 확인;
  note right
  사실 조회 우선순위
  1. Game State
  2. Runtime-added Facts
  3. Scenario Model
  4. Storybook RAG
  5. fallback 생성
  end note
  if (기존 사실로 충분한가?) then (yes)
  else (no)
    :Storybook RAG 조회;
    if (source fact 발견?) then (yes)
      :source fact 사용;
    else (no)
      :최소 Runtime-added Fact 후보 생성;
      if (확정된 play와 충돌?) then (yes)
        :후보 폐기 후\n호환 fallback 생성;
      endif
    endif
  endif
  :GM adjudication 및\nTurn Resolution 결정;
  :Player-visible narration 생성;
  while (Spoiler validation 통과?) is (unsafe)
    :narration만 안전하게 재생성;
  endwhile (safe)
  :Game State, Runtime-added Facts,\nplayer 결과를 atomic commit;
  if (resolution condition 충족?) then (yes)
    :Concluding Scene 생성·전달;
    :Adventure COMPLETED;
    stop
  endif
  if (문제 상태가 의미 있게 변했나?) then (yes)
    :새 Situation 구성;
  endif
repeat while (Adventure ACTIVE?) is (yes)
stop
@enduml
